## Better booked with us

Booking through this site rather than through an agent gets you:

- **10% off the room rate**, every day of the year
- **10% off the Royal Breakfast**
- **Check-in from 14:00** instead of 15:00
- **Check-out at 12:00** instead of 11:00
- **Your choice of how to pay**
